{"id":55160,"date":"2026-07-28T08:28:11","date_gmt":"2026-07-28T07:28:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55160"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:35:50","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:35:50","slug":"corrida-solidaria-aveiro-e-nosso-aauav","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-solidaria-aveiro-e-nosso-aauav\/","title":{"rendered":"Corrida Solid\u00e1ria \u2013 Aveiro \u00e9 Nosso | AAUAv 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Corrida Solid\u00e1ria \u2013 Aveiro \u00e9 Nosso | AAUAv 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A 5\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Corrida Solid\u00e1ria \u2013 Aveiro \u00e9 Nosso | AAUAv 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>10 de outubro de 2026<\/strong>, na cidade dos canais em <strong>Aveiro<\/strong>. Promovida pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica da Universidade de Aveiro (AAUAv)<\/strong> atrav\u00e9s dos setores Aveiro \u00e9 Nosso e Desporto e Bem-Estar, a prova alia o desporto universit\u00e1rio \u00e0 solidariedade social em prol da comunidade local.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com partida e chegada junto \u00e0 <strong>Casa do Estudante<\/strong> no <strong>Campus Universit\u00e1rio de Santiago<\/strong>, o evento conta com a prova competitiva de <strong>Corrida (10 km)<\/strong> com cronometragem oficial da <strong>Lap2Go<\/strong> e uma participativa <strong>Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria (5 km)<\/strong> aberta a fam\u00edlias, estudantes e atletas de todas as idades.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 10:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: 